  id: RiverBridgeWood
  displayName: Wooden Bridge
  description: Planks on piles driven into the riverbed, with a rope rail. Reaches
    3 tiles out from the bank. Drag out a straight line over the water; everyone
    can walk over it, raiders too, and they wear it down as they cross. Boats can't
    pass it.
